@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Observation producer" as Source
package "Outer Linux runtime" {
 component "NDJSON decoder" as Decoder
 component "Runner\nclock + bounded loop" as Runner #F1F5F9
 component "One worker\ninference adapter" as Worker
 component "Atomic JSON writer" as Writer
}
component "PresenceMonitor\ncoordinator + one pending window" as Monitor #DCEAF6
component "Domain values + rules\nwindow, qualification, current-state policy" as Domain #E2F3E9
rectangle "Local consumer\nindependent expiry check" as Consumer
Source -right-> Decoder : one local stream
Decoder --> Runner : normalized values
Runner <--> Monitor : explicit time / facts / completion\nplain job / approved result
Monitor --> Domain : pure calls
Runner -> Worker : immutable job\none running job
Worker --> Runner : outcome + job / generation IDs
Runner --> Writer : approved result only
Writer --> Consumer : one atomic JSON file
legend bottom
Runtime flow; boxes are responsibilities, not interfaces or services.
Coordinator never calls the worker, clock or writer directly.
endlegend
@enduml
